.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE ITEM ADD"
.SH NAME
hamstik release item add \- Add the Work Item to one or more release versions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release item add [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add the Work Item to one or more release versions
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.TP
.I RELEASE_ID
Release version ids (UUIDs)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --confirm-released-scope-correction
Confirm correcting the scope of a released Work Item
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --reason
Why the membership changed
.TP
.B --force
Bypass revision conflict protection (If-Match: *)
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
